Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 18:17:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] fix: draw cid: images in the message body

A multipart/related message points at its pictures with cid: URLs, which
the reader's WebView cannot resolve and its CSP would refuse anyway. Rewrite
each reference that names an image part into a data: URI, and keep those
parts out of the attachment list. A message that is a single inline image
(a newsletter) showed a blank body and an "attachment" chip.
